                            "книжн. почтенный, представительный, достойный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ce09903-259d-4042-bcb7-fb07aa0d53e0",
                                "sense_id": "b3d2d6ee-b973-3e65-8bdc-1f9972ed509b",
                                "text": "Респектабельный вид."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2cf03498-b6c2-3369-98ab-57e4f2e9b2b8",
                        "entry_id": "b41f9832-c756-3ddf-b299-473153031ef1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "пользующийся высокой репутацией"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a2b5a1b4-45a4-4417-a7e4-4a4957f5efb9",
                        "source_entry_id": "b41f9832-c756-3ddf-b299-473153031ef1",
                        "target_lang_word": "respectable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "respectable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8870a2b9-c2be-3590-a885-9fb462249b39",
                                        "entry_id": "ae6111f1-bd84-32a7-894f-4f876a7483a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Deserving respect."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2bfbf02-f184-4b86-8178-2c1f2434fae1",
                                                "sense_id": "8870a2b9-c2be-3590-a885-9fb462249b39",
                                                "text": "His accomplishments, morals, loyalty, and stature make him a respectable person."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aed99aaf-9c2e-4401-8eb0-e82b27b777bc",
                                                "sense_id": "8870a2b9-c2be-3590-a885-9fb462249b39",
                                                "text": "In former days every tavern of repute kept such a room for its own select circle, a club, or society, of habitués, who met every evening, for a pipe and a cheerful glass. In this way all respectable burgesses, down to fifty years ago, spent their evenings."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "90031d9c-3701-3986-b855-e75d20adce5b",
                                        "entry_id": "ae6111f1-bd84-32a7-894f-4f876a7483a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Decent; satisfactory."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4cc15c4-b08a-49ff-b293-19eb2c935f07",
                                                "sense_id": "90031d9c-3701-3986-b855-e75d20adce5b",
                                                "text": "Turn up to the interview wearing something respectable.  She plays a respectable game of chess.  He got a respectable B+ on his last exam."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "74f834ee-e2bb-3465-9bae-3f9a437a313d",
                                        "entry_id": "ae6111f1-bd84-32a7-894f-4f876a7483a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Moderately well-to-do."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "respectable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff45c349-8d30-3d8f-9dcc-f3ee1d52df04",
                                        "entry_id": "47cdeffb-a4a4-398e-9dd7-ec9631e6a17b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who is respectable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e241073a-cde2-422c-8ded-6b38921c13c0",
                                                "sense_id": "ff45c349-8d30-3d8f-9dcc-f3ee1d52df04",
                                                "text": "They forced their way into the meetings called by the respectables; and the respectables disappeared. It was of their own respectable good pleasure that they withdrew."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "804a20f3-e79a-4f85-ba7e-236904e46ccf",
                                                "sense_id": "ff45c349-8d30-3d8f-9dcc-f3ee1d52df04",
                                                "text": "The tensions between the \"respectables\" and the \"gay spoilers\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4474847-e90f-4c42-ae6b-dde94c38ab40",
                                                "sense_id": "ff45c349-8d30-3d8f-9dcc-f3ee1d52df04",
                                                "text": "The “respectables”, then, impute to themselves an absence of such character blemishes, or stated in more positive terms, an allegiance to American mainstream morality."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
